msgstr "&Copiar al portapapeles"

#. Button that starts the download of the puzzle database. Button that starts
#. the tablebase download.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/graphical_interface/download_dialog.py:100
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/graphical_interface/download_dialog.py:175
