#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/endgame/drills.py:69
msgid ""
"Checkmate in under 20 moves. Keep your king on the same rank or file as the "
"other king, next to the rook, and push the king to the edge."
msgstr ""
"Jaque mate en menos de 20 jugadas. Mantén tu rey en la misma fila o columna "
