#. Name of the training plan about winning material, shown in a combo box.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/trainer.py:86
msgid "Win material: forks, pins, skewers and defenders"
msgstr "Ganar material: ataques dobles, clavadas, pinchos y defensores"

#. Description of the lesson on the king and the opposition.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/endgame/lessons.py:133
msgid ""
"With king and pawn against king the king leads, the pawn goes last. The "
"opposition decides who passes, and the rook pawn is the exception that "
"draws."
msgstr ""
"Con rey y peón contra rey, el rey va delante y el peón al final. La "
"oposición decide quién pasa, y el peón de torre es la excepción que entabla."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/endgame/lessons.py:265
msgid ""
"With the king behind its pawn and the defending king in front, the attacking"
" king never gets past. Draw. This is why the king must lead."
msgstr ""
"Con el rey detrás de su peón y el rey defensor delante, el rey atacante "
"nunca pasa. Tablas. Por eso el rey tiene que ir delante."

#. Spoken at the end of a drill or lesson that used tablebase hints; {hints}
#. is a number.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/endgame_board.py:94
msgid ""
"With {hints} hints from the tablebase: it counts as practice, not as held."
msgstr ""
"Con {hints} pistas de la tablebase: cuenta como práctica, no como mantenida."

#. Spoken when the mate came within the drill's target.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/endgame/drills.py:248
msgid "Within the target of under {target} moves."
msgstr "Dentro del objetivo de menos de {target} jugadas."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/endgame/lessons.py:301
msgid ""
"Without the move it is a draw: Black plays the king in front of the pawn, "
"and after the pawn checks on the seventh the attacking king cannot support "
"it without stalemate. A pawn that checks on the seventh is the sign of a "
"draw."
msgstr ""
"Sin el turno son tablas: las negras ponen el rey delante del peón, y después"
" del jaque del peón en séptima el rey atacante no puede apoyarlo sin ahogar."
" Un peón que da jaque en séptima es la señal de las tablas."

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/theme_names.py:284
msgid "X-ray attack"
msgstr "Ataque por rayos X"

#. Option in the draw offer menu.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/user_driven.py:348
msgid "Yes, accept offer and end game"
msgstr "Sí, aceptar la oferta y terminar la partida"

#. Option in the menu shown when Escape is pressed during a game.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/base.py:319
msgid "Yes, leave"
msgstr "Sí, salir"

#. Where the player is in the endgame lessons, e.g. "You are at: 3. King and
#. pawn against king."
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/study_log.py:304
msgid "You are at: {lesson}."
msgstr "Estás en: {lesson}."

#. Material balance against the player, in pawn units.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/announcements.py:106
msgid "You are down {points}."
msgstr "Vas perdiendo {points}."

#. Material balance in the player's favor, in pawn units.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/announcements.py:103
msgid "You are up {points}."
msgstr "Vas ganando {points}."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/endgame/lessons.py:460
msgid ""
"You defend. Keep the rook on your third rank (the sixth from the other side)"
" so the attacking king cannot cross. When the pawn reaches that rank, the "
"rook goes to the last rank and checks from behind. Draw."
msgstr ""
"Tú defiendes. Mantén la torre en tu tercera fila (la sexta desde el otro "
"lado) para que el rey atacante no pueda cruzar. Cuando el peón llegue a esa "
"fila, la torre va a la última fila y da jaques desde atrás. Tablas."

#. Spoken in the material count.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/announcements.py:112
msgid "You have the bishop pair."
msgstr "Tienes la pareja de alfiles."

#. Shown when the installed puzzle database is already the latest.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/graphical_interface/download_dialog.py:187
msgid "Your puzzle database is up to date (Lichess base of {when})."
msgstr "Tu base de problemas está actualizada (base de Lichess de {when})."

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/theme_names.py:286
