#. How a game ended, spoken at game over (a loss by the rules of a chess
#. variant).
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/spoken_messages.py:112
msgid "loss by the rules of the variant"
msgstr "derrota por las reglas de la variante"

#. How a game ended, spoken at game over (the automatic 75-move rule).
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/spoken_messages.py:102
