msgstr "regla de los setenta y cinco movimientos"

#. How a game ended, spoken at game over. Spoken when a position on the
#. analysis board is stalemate.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/spoken_messages.py:98
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/analysis_board.py:800
