"{file} did not arrive whole (attempt {attempt} of {attempts}: {reason}). "
"Downloading it again."
msgstr ""
"{file} no llegó completo (intento {attempt} de {attempts}: {reason}). "
"Descargándolo de nuevo."

#. Explains the review queue in the study log.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/study_log.py:251
msgid ""
"A missed puzzle comes back the next day; two clean reviews in a row, days "
"apart, make it firm. Up to {count} reviews open each tactics session."
msgstr ""
"Un problema fallado vuelve al día siguiente; dos repasos limpios seguidos, "
"con días de por medio, lo dejan firme. Hasta {count} repasos abren cada "
"sesión de táctica."

#. Spoken after a clean review that makes the puzzle firm.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/puzzle_board.py:588
msgid "Clean review. This one is firm: it leaves the review queue."
msgstr "Repaso limpio. Este quedó firme: sale de la cola de repaso."

#. Spoken when the player chose not to skip the reviews.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/puzzle_board.py:241
msgid "Good choice. Back to the review."
msgstr "Bien. De vuelta al repaso."

#. The review queue in the study log, e.g. "In the queue: 3 due today, 5
#. waiting for their day. Firm: 2.".
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/study_log.py:245
msgid ""
"In the queue: {due} due today, {waiting} waiting for their day. Firm: "
"{firm}."
msgstr ""
"En la cola: {due} para hoy, {waiting} esperando su día. Firmes: {firm}."

#. Spoken after the first wrong move of a review: it will be reviewed again.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/puzzle_board.py:452
msgid "It comes back tomorrow. Keep going to learn the solution."
msgstr "Vuelve mañana. Sigue para aprender la solución."

#. Shown in the study log when no puzzle was ever missed.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/study_log.py:242
msgid "No missed puzzles to review."
msgstr "No hay problemas fallados para repasar."

#. Heading of the review part of the study log: puzzles the player missed.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/graphical_interface/study_dialog.py:93
msgid "Puzzles you missed"
msgstr "Problemas que fallaste"

#. Window title during a review of a missed puzzle.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/puzzle_board.py:357
msgid "Review of tactic {puzzle_id} - rating {rating}"
msgstr "Repaso de la táctica {puzzle_id} - rating {rating}"

#. Spoken when a review puzzle loads, e.g. "Review 1 of 3: a puzzle you
#. missed. Not rated.".
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/puzzle_board.py:313
msgid "Review {number} of {total}: a puzzle you missed. Not rated."
msgstr ""
"Repaso {number} de {total}: un problema que fallaste. No cuenta para el "
"rating."

#. Spoken when the first new puzzle follows the reviews.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessStudy/virtual_chessboard/puzzle_board.py:332
